// EditorCommon: paths, logging and small reflection / asset helpers shared by the editor build scripts (imported from
// Thread; MASTER_PROMPT 7.1: everything is regenerated by RebuildAll; no manual editor steps).
// Every log line starts with "[NOC] " and every problem with "[NOC-FAIL] ", which Tools/unity-queue.ps1 greps.
